@api = http://localhost:5027
@token = COLE_AQUI_UM_ACCESS_TOKEN

GET {{api}}/api/tarefas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar (resposta 201)
POST {{api}}/api/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"titulo": "Revisar modelos de serviço em nuvem"}

### Validação (resposta 400)
POST {{api}}/api/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"titulo": "   "}

### Substitua 1 pelo ID retornado no cadastro
PATCH {{api}}/api/tarefas/1/concluir
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reabrir a tarefa
PATCH {{api}}/api/tarefas/1/reabrir
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Editar a tarefa
PATCH {{api}}/api/tarefas/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"titulo": "Revisar CI/CD"}

### Apagar a tarefa (resposta 204)
DELETE {{api}}/api/tarefas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
